<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-LEICESTER WIN ENGLISH CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-LEICESTER WIN ENGLISH CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leicester beat Sale 9-3 (halftime</p>
<p>6-3) in the English rugby union Pilkington cup final at</p>
<p>Twicketnham on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Leicester -  Penalties: Joel Stransky 3</p>
<p>Sale - Penalty:  Simon Mannix.</p>
<p>Attendance: 75,</p>
</text>
